{
  "key": 20267,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re a rookie Trainer, aren’t you?\n",
        "I can tell!\r",
        "That’s OK! Everyone is a rookie\n",
        "at some point!\r",
        "If you’d like, I can teach you a\n",
        "few things.\f",
        "OK, then! Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Ohh... I’m sorry.\n",
        "I forgot that you weren’t wearing the\f",
        "Running Shoes!\r",
        "I’ll try to go as slow as possible, so\n",
        "try keeping up!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "This is a Pokémon Center. They heal\n",
        "your Pokémon in no time at all.\r",
        "You’ll be relying on them a lot, so\n",
        "you better learn about them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "This is a Pokémon Mart.\n",
        "They sell Poké Balls for catching wild\f",
        "Pokémon and other useful items.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Route 30 is out this way.\r",
        "Trainers will be battling their\n",
        "Pokémon there.\r",
        "If you go a little farther,\n",
        "you’ll see Mr. Pokémon’s House.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the sea, as you can see.\r",
        "Some Pokémon are found only in water.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Here...\n",
        "It’s my house!\r",
        "For your effort keeping up with me,\n",
        "I’ll give you my Running Shoes!\f",
        "They’re still warm!\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Got you, didn’t I?\n",
        "Don’t worry, these are brand new!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Running Shoes from the Guide Gent!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The instructions read,\n",
        "“Touch the Sprint Button on the\f",
        "Touch Screen to sprint.”\r",
        "It also says,\n",
        "“Hold the B Button down to sprint.”\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "...Hffp... Hffp...\n",
        "I made it...\r",
        "I forgot about one thing.\n",
        "This is another token from me!\r",
        "Take it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "The Guide Gent loaded the Map Card\n",
        "on {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear\n",
        "can now show the Town Map!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Select the Pokégear on the\n",
        "Touch Screen and then select\f",
        "the Town Map icon.\r",
        "You’ll see the map of the region\n",
        "you’re currently in!\r",
        "The Pokégear becomes more useful as\n",
        "you add Cards.\r",
        "I wish you luck on your journey!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "...\r",
        "You got a Pokémon at the Lab.\n",
        "What a waste.\r",
        "That’s a Pokémon that’s too good for\n",
        "a wimp like you.\r",
        "...\n",
        "Don’t you get what I’m saying?\r",
        "Well, I too have a good Pokémon.\n",
        "I’ll show you what I mean!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "...\r",
        "Do you want to know who I am?\n",
        "...\r",
        "I’m going to be the world’s greatest\n",
        "Pokémon Trainer.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Give it back!\n",
        "That’s my Trainer Card!\r",
        "Oh no!\n",
        "You saw my name...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you talk to the old man by the\n",
        "Pokémon Center?\r",
        "He’ll put a Map of Johto on your\n",
        "Pokégear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "When you’re with Pokémon,\n",
        "going anywhere is fun."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Mr. Pokémon’s house is still farther\n",
        "up ahead.\r",
        "You could use the Running Shoes if\n",
        "you had a pair.\r",
        "But beware of wild Pokémon and\n",
        "Trainers!\r",
        "When you run, the noise will\n",
        "attract them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "I battled the Trainers on the road.\n",
        "My Pokémon lost.\r",
        "They’re a mess! I must take them to\n",
        "a Pokémon Center."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "A Pokémon I caught had an item.\n",
        "I think it’s Mystic Water.\r",
        "I don’t need it, so do you want it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00021",
      "en_US": "Back to fishing for me, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00022",
      "en_US": "You don’t have room for this."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Cherrygrove City\n",
        "The City of Fragrant Flowers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0550_T21_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Guide Gent’s House\n",
        "Full-of-Energy, High-Speed Old Man"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
